        "2438 - وَ قَالَ أَمِيرُ اَلْمُؤْمِنِينَ عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ : «لاَ تَصْحَبَنَّ فِي سَفَرٍ مَنْ لاَ يَرَى لَكَ مِنَ اَلْفَضْلِ عَلَيْهِ كَمَا تَرَى لَهُ عَلَيْكَ »."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.2438 - Commander of the Faithful Imam Ali ibn Abi Talib (as) said:\n\"Do not accompany in travel anyone who does not regard you with the same esteem that you regard them.\""
        ]
      }
